# The repository root ignores *.a and *.so so that build output never gets committed by accident.
# The driver libraries here are deliberate: they are checked in until the per-target driver modules
# exist, so they have to be exempted or `git add` skips them silently.
#
# Named exactly rather than by extension, so an unrelated archive that lands anywhere under this
# directory stays ignored rather than being swept in by `git add -A`.
!linux_amd64/libazurecosmosdriver.so
